Z||000009||sloth85GT||10-09-2001||02:13 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by sqoach:<BR><B>You <I>killed</I> a Z24??? What year was it? Those cars are not slow. Not fast either, but I think it'd be a close race with one of those. My friend's mom has a 98 and it's pretty damn quick.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>It was a 99 or 00 I think. The guy wanted to get into my lane on Main street here so that he can turn onto Portage (you peggers will know what I mean) and he rolled down his window and said "Are you gonna make me earn that lane?". I said "Of course". Then we peeled off and I was ahead by about one and a half car lengths. At the next light he asked "Whatcha got in there?" and I said I have a 2.8 V6. I asked him what he has and he said it was the 150hp 2.4(?? I think it's 2.4). But I know it was the 150hp version. So yes, I did kill a Z24, I also forgot to mention that the Beretta was a GTZ.||||reg||1
